@display("std/process")
process: component(path = "std/process", lang = "heron") {
  | Processes as a capability of a run: arguments are a list, so nothing is parsed or quoted by a shell.
  |
  | Its surface is declared in `std/process/package.heron`, whose types the API
  | reference renders; each export is specified where its behaviour is:
  |
  | | Export           | Specified in                                                                                                                         |
  | | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
  | | `run`, `Process` | [Processes](#language.scripting.processes_and_files.processes)                                                                       |
  | | `ProcessError`   | [Processes](#language.scripting.processes_and_files.processes), [declared errors](#language.scripting.code.failures.declared_errors) |
  | | `sh`             | [Quoting](#language.scripting.processes_and_files.quoting)                                                                           |

  uses = [language.std.types]
}
